GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/retail/amazon-holiday-beauty-event-2026</guid><category>Retail</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/7db1780/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1125+0+0/resize/767x431!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2F44%2Ff0%2F5c1c22304df691060a6025e50b33%2Fholiday-event-hero-amazon-news-10122026.jpg"/></item><item><title>How Amazon’s $100 million Right Now Climate Fund is protecting and restoring nature around the world</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/sustainability/right-now-climate-fund?utm_source=rss</link><description>Get the latest on how the fund is investing in nature-based climate projects across more than 15 countries.</description><pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 08:04:00 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/sustainability/right-now-climate-fund</guid><category>Sustainability</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/3b3e478/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1125x1125+438+0/resize/605x605!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2F18%2F28%2F491e8860468392ba64fb1fbb34f4%2Frncf-hero-2000x1125-4.jpg"/></item><item><title>Amazon in the community: Here’s what’s happening in Seattle, Bellevue, and the Puget Sound</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/community/amazon-seattle-bellevue-puget-sound-news?utm_source=rss</link><description>Learn how we invest in the community, help power the local economy, and support our employees in the Puget Sound region.</description><pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 17:58:00 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/community/amazon-seattle-bellevue-puget-sound-news</guid><category>Community</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/fa71e99/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1125x1125+438+0/resize/605x605!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2Ff2%2Fe4%2F6f67188e480392ce0b19a6671b59%2Fspheres-rolling-blog-hero-1.jpg"/></item><item><title>How Amazon supported communities impacted by the Colombia earthquake</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/community/colombia-earthquake-amazon-disaster-relief?utm_source=rss</link><description>Amazon donated emergency supplies, rallied over 150 volunteers, and partnered with five organizations to support earthquake recovery.</description><pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 16:28:00 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/community/colombia-earthquake-amazon-disaster-relief</guid><category>Community</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/a81f7ff/2147483647/strip/true/crop/900x900+350+0/resize/605x605!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2F4c%2F1f%2F6fdfb9b54f42919d50fdf8572663%2Fcolumbia-amazon-volunteer-disasterrelief-amazonnews-cdlt-10122026.png"/></item><item><title>Watch the teaser trailer for ‘Bloodaxe,’ the epic Viking drama coming to Prime Video January 20, 2027</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/entertainment/bloodaxe-vikings-prime-video?utm_source=rss</link><description>The highly anticipated new series, which has been renewed for Season 2, is helmed by Michael Hirst (creator of ‘Vikings’) and Horatio Hirst.</description><pubDate>Fri, 09 Oct 2026 18:15:34 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/entertainment/bloodaxe-vikings-prime-video</guid><category>Entertainment</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/ac86744/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1125+0+0/resize/767x431!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2Fc8%2F08%2Ffc9a2e7c4f2cb7289a5df596b6cd%2Fbloodaxe-hero-amazon-news.png"/></item><item><title> &apos;Love Me Love Me 3,&apos; the next sequel in the hit romantic drama series, coming to Prime Video</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/entertainment/love-me-love-me-3-prime-video?utm_source=rss</link><description>The third film will continue the young adult saga based on Stefania S.&apos;s international best-selling novels.</description><pubDate>Fri, 09 Oct 2026 13:56:06 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/entertainment/love-me-love-me-3-prime-video</guid><category>Entertainment</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/3e3a7ae/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1125+0+0/resize/767x431!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2F38%2F7c%2Fe74a6c4b41b68813d8172e2e3906%2Flove-me-love-me-3-announce-hero-amazon-news.png"/></item><item><title>From zero to 1,000: How Amazon Leo built one of the world&apos;s largest satellite production lines</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/stories/how-amazon-leo-builds-satellites?utm_source=rss</link><description>Amazon has built more than 1,000 satellites for its growing constellation—and it&apos;s just getting started.</description><pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 16:01:58 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/stories/how-amazon-leo-builds-satellites</guid><category>Amazon Leo</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/8b8030f/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1125+0+0/resize/767x431!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2F17%2F4f%2Fe71ce5a9489b96590d7601270f7d%2Fleomanufacturing-inline002-amazon-news-lj-20261007-still.jpg"/></item><item><title>How AWS is helping companies build physical AI machines that think</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/aws/aws-physical-ai-toolchain-build-intelligent-machines?utm_source=rss</link><description>Amazon launched the Physical AI Toolchain on AWS, an open-source stack that helps manufacturers build machines that perceive, reason, and act in the real world.</description><pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 13:00:13 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/aws/aws-physical-ai-toolchain-build-intelligent-machines</guid><category>AWS</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/4fda31b/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1125+0+0/resize/767x431!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2F2b%2Fe8%2F55307dea410f85c7408920cf8b85%2Fabout-amazon-hero-ai-toolchain-hero-amazon-news-lt-092926.jpg"/></item><item><title>Amazon announces an all-new family of tablets designed just for kids</title><link>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/devices/new-amazon-kids-tablets?utm_source=rss</link><description>New Amazon Kids Tablets available in two models for younger and older kids</description><pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 12:55:18 GMT</pubDate><guid>https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/devices/new-amazon-kids-tablets</guid><category>Devices</category><media:thumbnail url="https://assets.aboutamazon.com/dims4/default/7e5cae7/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1126+0+0/resize/767x432!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fassets.aboutamazon.com%2Fb3%2F34%2F9d2f58c54f8ca89c10292d18195d%2Famazon-kidstablets-amazonnews-inline-ck10726.png"/></item></channel></rss>